  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "SALLY'S ACCOUNT\n\n [ Requests, Balance,\n   Owner ]\n\nThe first hole is a NEST.\nMessages land on it one at a\ntime; a robot lifts the top\none off, does what it says,\nand the nest is bare again --\nso the team dozes until the\nnext message comes.\n\nA message says what to do:\n\n [ \"deposit\",  50 ]\n [ \"withdraw\", 30 ]\n [ \"query\", a bird ]"
   },
   "x": 1.25,
   "z": 2.28
  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nGive the account box to the\nTeller. It waits.\n\nDrop a message on the bird\nmarked \"requests\" and she\ncarries it to the nest. The\nrobot whose thought carries\nthat word wakes, serves it,\nand dozes again.\n\nA query answers on the nest\nmarked \"answers\". Its bird\ngoes with the message and\nis used up. For another,\ntake a nest from its stack\nand set it down: its egg\nhatches a bird of its own."
   },
   "x": -1.35,
   "z": 1.18
  }
